## The Recurrence, Derived

```
current_sum = max(nums[i], current_sum + nums[i])   // extend vs restart
max_sum     = max(max_sum, current_sum)              // record the best ever seen
```

- `current_sum` — best sum of a subarray **ending exactly at index i**. Goes up and down.
- `max_sum` — best sum seen **anywhere so far**. Only ever moves up — a high-water mark.

