5. **Only then move to variations** — Maximum Product Subarray, Circular Maximum Subarray, Maximum Sum Rectangle (2D), K-Concatenation Maximum Sum. Each one changes exactly one assumption from this base problem — use the Keyword Autopsy table as your template for reasoning about each.

